	(text "ramBar link (J19, JST-GH 6 pin vertical). Pick either link in firmware, or use both:\n- UART5 (PC12 TX, PD2 RX), 3.3 V logic. R54 holds RX high when ramBar is unplugged.\n- CAN FD on FDCAN2 (PB13 TX, PB12 RX) through U16, a 3.3 V TCAN334G. R53 terminates this end; ramBar must terminate its end.\n  Y1 (8 MHz) is fitted for the CAN clock.\n- 5 V to ramBar through F4 (0.5 A hold). U17 is ESD on TX and RX; D12 (NUP2105L) clamps CANH and CANL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40.64 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4af98c46-3218-4739-b5a4-482a1cb85442"))
